1.  To customize paths, edit inr_paths.sh, and pipe_paths.sh
    Ideally, you should not have to modify the Makefile.

2.  To setup the INR system, do:
      make inr-config
      make inr-install

3.  To set up the processing pipeline, do:
      make pipe-setup-root
      make pipe-setup-nodes

4.  To run the INR system and processing pipeline together, do:
      ./pipe.sh start
      make inr-start

    To feed data into the system, provide a list of input file paths,
    and then do:
      make inr-feed
